---
title: Seal Contract Enforcement at Every Orchestration Operation
---
flowchart LR
    classDef gated fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#991b1b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef ungated fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#166534
    classDef gate fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#92400e,stroke-width:3px

    caller[Caller: orchestrator, UI, MCP, etc.]

    subgraph Decorator["@requires_bootstrap_mode decorator"]
        check{Cached mode<br/>still valid?}:::gate
        fetch[Fetch current_mode<br/>from seal authority]:::gate
        verify{mode ==<br/>BOOTSTRAP?}:::gate
    end

    auth[(seal_authority<br/>service)]

    op[Operation body executes]:::gated
    err[Raise SealedModeError]
    integrity[Raise SealIntegrityError<br/>HARD STOP]

    caller --> check
    check -->|yes, < 500ms TTL| verify
    check -->|no| fetch
    fetch -->|REST or in-proc| auth
    auth -->|mode| verify
    auth -.->|tampered| integrity
    verify -->|BOOTSTRAP| op
    verify -->|SEALED / FACTORY / INVESTIGATION| err

    subgraph Examples["Examples of GATED operations"]
        direction LR
        ex1[propose_ontology_update]:::gated
        ex2[push_embedding_model]:::gated
        ex3[update_retention_policy]:::gated
        ex4[normalize_voice_tag]:::gated
        ex5[propose_canonical_label]:::gated
        ex6[activate_proposal]:::gated
    end

    subgraph NonGated["Operations that work in ALL modes"]
        direction LR
        ng1[capture_sample_window]:::ungated
        ng2[get_capsule_manifest]:::ungated
        ng3[record_voice_tag]:::ungated
        ng4[query_catalog]:::ungated
        ng5[get_current_mode]:::ungated
    end

    subgraph SubscriberPath["Mode-change subscription"]
        sub[Mode change pushed<br/>by authority]:::gate
        invalidate[Cache invalidated<br/>immediately]:::gate
        sub --> invalidate
    end

    subgraph ModeNote["INVESTIGATION vs BOOTSTRAP"]
        note1[GPU Platform powered in both modes,<br/>but only BOOTSTRAP permits<br/>orchestration writes.<br/>INVESTIGATION = read-only inference,<br/>15-min session, auto crypto-erase.]:::gate
    end

    auth -.->|push notify| sub
    invalidate -.->|next call refetches| check
